[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1740.389, "timestamp": "00:29:00", "text": "自称一匹狼タイプなところも好きです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1742.23, "timestamp": "00:29:02", "text": "よし、Twitchに広告が表示された。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1744.389, "timestamp": "00:29:04", "text": "少し待ちましょう。   わからない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1746.31, "timestamp": "00:29:06", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1751.35, "timestamp": "00:29:11", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1753.35, "timestamp": "00:29:13", "text": "私はセラピストではないので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1756.63, "timestamp": "00:29:16", "text": "適切なアドバイスなどはできませんが、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1759.6, "timestamp": "00:29:19", "author": "@sarthaksharma2476", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kmJohYAdmpQzCNN96t58cLSK8spv6Y2ITutBFF9nvi9Z8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "but i looked at mirror i see a clown there"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1764.549, "timestamp": "00:29:24", "text": "話せる人と話すのが一番だと思います。   わかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1767.029, "timestamp": "00:29:27", "text": "。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1767.914, "timestamp": "00:29:27", "author": "@sarthaksharma2476", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kmJohYAdmpQzCNN96t58cLSK8spv6Y2ITutBFF9nvi9Z8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "then i laugh"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1773.11, "timestamp": "00:29:33", "text": "チャンスや人との繋がりを自ら閉ざしてはいけません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1776.47, "timestamp": "00:29:36", "text": "後悔するぞ。 正直言って、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1778.549, "timestamp": "00:29:38", "text": "あなたは私がなぜ時間を無駄にしたのか不思議に思うでしょう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1781.669, "timestamp": "00:29:41", "text": "なぜ私はあんなことをしたのだろう？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1788.389, "timestamp": "00:29:48", "text": "人々は私が彼らを避けているとか、関係を断ち切ろうとしているなどと思ったようです。そうではなく、"}]